Your current solution has a good foundation: data upload, energy analytics, geographic visualization, high-consumption detection, and improvement planning. However, it does not yet address every research gap identified in your literature review.

The biggest improvement is to make UrbanEnergy Insight geographically adaptable, fair when comparing different locations, explainable, and capable of turning analytical findings into measurable improvement plans.

